$\mathrm{F}=\mathrm{qE}=\frac{\mathrm{qV}}{\mathrm{ d}}$<br/>This should be equal to the weight of the particle
$\begin{aligned}
& \therefore \quad \mathrm{mg}=\frac{\mathrm{qV}}{\mathrm{ d}} \\
