\end{aligned}\begin{array}{ll}\quad 1 & =k \frac{y^2}{x^2} \quad \ldots\left(\because F_1=F_2\right) \\ \therefore \quad & \frac{y}{x}=\frac{1}{\sqrt{k}}\end{array}$

